            "description": "<html><body><p data-eci=\"true\"><figure class=\"getty-figure\" data-type=\"getty-image\"><picture><img alt=\"Stressful occupation and work concept\" data-id=\"1082095526\" data-type=\"getty-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"1024\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 36px), (max-width: 1023px) calc(100vw - 132px), (max-width: 1199px) calc(100vw - 666px), (max-width: 1307px) calc(100vw - 708px), 600px\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1082095526/image_1082095526.jpg?io=getty-c-w630\" srcset=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1082095526/image_1082095526.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536 1536w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1082095526/image_1082095526.jpg?io=getty-c-w1280 1280w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1082095526/image_1082095526.jpg?io=getty-c-w1080 1080w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1082095526/image_1082095526.jpg?io=getty-c-w750 750w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1082095526/image_1082095526.jpg?io=getty-c-w640 640w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1082095526/image_1082095526.jpg?io=getty-c-w480 480w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1082095526/image_1082095526.jpg?io=getty-c-w320 320w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1082095526/image_1082095526.jpg?io=getty-c-w240 240w\" width=\"1536\"/></picture><figcaption><p class=\"item-credits\">peshkov/iStock via Getty Images</p></figcaption></figure></p>  <h3><strong>Introduction:</strong></h3> <p>The midterm elections are already over. The market (futures) first slumped overnight on 3rd Nov., but then rallied hard on the day after the midterms. Then on the very next day, it lost all the gains of the previous day and</p></body></html>",
