            "description": "<html><body><p data-eci=\"true\"><figure class=\"getty-figure\" data-type=\"getty-image\"><picture> <img alt=\"Abstract connections\" data-id=\"1988673508\" data-type=\"getty-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"987\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 36px), (max-width: 1023px) calc(100vw - 132px), (max-width: 1199px) calc(100vw - 666px), (max-width: 1307px) calc(100vw - 708px), 600px\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1988673508/image_1988673508.jpg?io=getty-c-w630\" srcset=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1988673508/image_1988673508.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536 1536w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1988673508/image_1988673508.jpg?io=getty-c-w1280 1280w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1988673508/image_1988673508.jpg?io=getty-c-w1080 1080w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1988673508/image_1988673508.jpg?io=getty-c-w750 750w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1988673508/image_1988673508.jpg?io=getty-c-w640 640w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1988673508/image_1988673508.jpg?io=getty-c-w480 480w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1988673508/image_1988673508.jpg?io=getty-c-w320 320w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1988673508/image_1988673508.jpg?io=getty-c-w240 240w\" width=\"1536\"/> </picture><figcaption><p class=\"item-caption\"> </p> <p class=\"item-credits\">J Studios/DigitalVision via Getty Images</p></figcaption></figure></p>  <h2>ET stock: Graham P/E suggests a large discount after FQ3 earnings</h2> <p>I last analyzed Energy Transfer LP stock (<span class=\"ticker-hover-wrapper\"><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/ET\" title=\"Energy Transfer LP Common Units\">ET</a></span>) on August 31 with a focus on insider transactions and a <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4941709-energy-transfer-stock-august-insider-purchases-may-signal-price-breakout\">buy rating</a></p></body></html>",
